d, what tends to put you off or take away from the experience?","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-12T10:14:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262697225","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4454280-1842212951303477","game_id":"steam-4454280","kind":"update","title":"Title Update","summary":"Cozy Archivist Simulator is now ARCHIVIST: Tidy Up & Sort The store assets and branding have also been updated to match the new title. This is only a title and visual identity change. The game itself and its development direction remain unchanged. I'm also almost finished with the main changes for the demo update and expect to have it ready to upload soon. Once it's released, you'll be able to try out many of the changes based on the feedback I've received from you. I really appreciate how much ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-28T14:59:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951303477","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4454280-1833968530894094","game_id":"steam-4454280","kind":"announcement","title":"Sandbox Gameplay Trailer Is Now Available","summary":"Watch the Sandbox Mode Gameplay Trailer A new gameplay trailer is now available, focusing on Sandbox Mode. A demo featuring Sandbox Mode is coming soon to the Steam page. Thank you for your interest!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-30T18:49:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530894094","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"stea